== 3. 谁给 sidecar 加了 hardened runtime（T-03 记的那个起不来的原因）
PyInstaller 6.22.2 utils/osx.py:413-421 —— sign_binary(identity) 只在 identity 为假时
跳过硬运行时；我们的 pyinstaller_signing_args() 传的是字面量 '-'，它是真值：
def sign_binary(filename, identity=None, entitlements_file=None, deep=False):
    """
    Sign the binary using codesign utility. If no identity is provided, ad-hoc signing is performed.
    """
    extra_args = []
    if not identity:
        identity = '-'  # ad-hoc signing
    else:
        extra_args.append('--options=runtime')  # hardened runtime
    if entitlements_file:

$ codesign -dvv <刚构建、未重签的那个> | grep flags
CodeDirectory v=20500 size=21229 flags=0x10002(adhoc,runtime) hashes=656+2 location=embedded
$ codesign -dvv <output/ 里随包的那个> | grep flags
CodeDirectory v=20400 size=21200 flags=0x2(adhoc) hashes=656+2 location=embedded
$ codesign -dvv <刚构建、按 repair-macos-signing.sh 重签过的> | grep flags
CodeDirectory v=20400 size=21209 flags=0x2(adhoc) hashes=656+2 location=embedded
